1
00:00:45,168 --> 00:00:49,480
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,505 --> 00:00:51,377
=Episode 23=

3
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Tomorrow, at our wedding,

4
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,359
you will mix your blood

5
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,992
into this wine.

6
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,319
Blend it with mine.

7
00:01:16,366 --> 00:01:17,966
Drinking this union cup

8
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:23,799
and our demonic marriage will be sealed.

9
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,920
This wine

10
00:01:59,239 --> 00:02:00,640
is exquisite.

11
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:20,840
How can this be?

12
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:23,719
You drank it.

13
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,360
The deadliest poison
across the three realms?

14
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,759
Clever.

15
00:02:33,159 --> 00:02:35,560
But you only found two of the three.

16
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:40,560
You almost killed me.

17
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,960
What a shame.

18
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,400
Impossible.

19
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:47,680
We gathered all three.

20
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:48,960
How could it be only two?

21
00:03:00,159 --> 00:03:00,960
Master.

22
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,340
Lanxi.

23
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,000
Lanxi.

24
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,639
It's you.

25
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,639
Why?

26
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:16,800
She is just a puppet,

27
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,639
something to watch you with.

28
00:03:20,919 --> 00:03:23,639
Did you really think
she had an Underworld Soul?

29
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:25,080
Ridiculous.

30
00:03:26,718 --> 00:03:27,840
Kill her.

31
00:03:39,359 --> 00:03:40,159
Lanxi.

32
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,000
I knew you were fake.

33
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,759
I just wanted

34
00:03:47,159 --> 00:03:48,599
to stay with you a little longer.

35
00:03:49,105 --> 00:03:50,505
Even for a moment.

36
00:03:52,359 --> 00:03:53,080
But

37
00:03:53,153 --> 00:03:55,105
we finally found each other again.

38
00:03:55,129 --> 00:03:57,482
We were one step from happiness.

39
00:03:57,980 --> 00:03:59,064
Why?

40
00:03:59,183 --> 00:04:00,794
Why can't I have

41
00:04:00,818 --> 00:04:02,771
even the smallest bit of happiness?

42
00:04:05,946 --> 00:04:06,912
Kill her.

43
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,040
Lanxi.

44
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,720
Ziyan.

45
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:21,720
You dare defy me for her?

46
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,480
Ah!

47
00:04:28,892 --> 00:04:29,693
Ziyan.

48
00:04:30,599 --> 00:04:31,400
Lanxi.

49
00:04:41,272 --> 00:04:42,073
Lanxi!

50
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,080
Lanxi!

51
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,120
Lanxi!

52
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,399
I'll kill you!

53
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:01,959
Why?

54
00:05:01,983 --> 00:05:04,108
Two halves of the same Stone
repel each other.

55
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:07,199
That's why you could never touch me.

56
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:11,160
So you knew all along

57
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,600
that I'm the Stone too.

58
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,439
But knowing won't help you.

59
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:16,600
I will still

60
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:17,519
devour you

61
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:20,160
bit by bit.

62
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:57,639
Ah!

63
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:03,279
(Yuanchu!)

64
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:06,560
(Yuanchu!)

65
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,480
(Yuanchu!)

66
00:06:13,686 --> 00:06:14,486
(Yuanchu!)

67
00:06:22,160 --> 00:06:22,959
(Yuanchu!)

68
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:24,985
(Yuanchu!)

69
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,126
Yuanchu.

70
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:56,880
♪Flowers bloom in turn,
as day and night trade places♪

71
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:04,360
♪Tides rise and fall.
Who watches fate unfold?♪

72
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:11,600
♪Beneath the boundless sky,
I turn toward the break of dawn♪

73
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,200
♪Alone in this world,♪

74
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:19,600
♪Searching for the traces
buried in my heart.♪

75
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:23,960
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

76
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,900
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

77
00:07:27,045 --> 00:07:28,246
Who are you?

78
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:32,766
Heaven's Return Art.

79
00:07:35,838 --> 00:07:36,840
Focus your spirit.

80
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,146
Focus your spirit.

81
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,960
♪Do not forget the tangled paths♪

82
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:49,240
♪That you and I have crossed♪

83
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:53,000
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

84
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,900
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

85
00:07:55,959 --> 00:07:56,759
Is it pretty?

86
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:02,840
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪

87
00:08:07,139 --> 00:08:07,939
Yuanchu.

88
00:08:12,693 --> 00:08:14,713
(When our minds clashed earlier,)

89
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,560
(it wiped my memory.)

90
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,160
(By a twist of fortune,)

91
00:08:19,779 --> 00:08:21,319
(my memories have all come back.)

92
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,720
Yuanchu,

93
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,360
I remember everything now.

94
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:31,279
I remember everything.

95
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:57,519
Your Love Flower bloomed because of him?

96
00:08:58,919 --> 00:08:59,879
How absurd.

97
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,600
Then I'll kill him first.

98
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:05,759
And then devour you.

99
00:09:08,159 --> 00:09:08,960
Mother!

100
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,679
My child.

101
00:09:17,679 --> 00:09:18,480
Mother!

102
00:09:18,505 --> 00:09:18,960
My child.

103
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:19,759
Mother!

104
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,200
Listen to me.

105
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,679
Run.

106
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:28,120
Stop fighting him.

107
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:32,519
You can't win.

108
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:34,360
Mother,

109
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,000
I am sorry.

110
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:37,879
I am truly sorry, mother.

111
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:41,240
This time, I can't run.

112
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,960
I don't want you to die.

113
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:50,440
I don't want you to die!

114
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,000
Mother.

115
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,166
Mother!

116
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:14,480
Mother!

117
00:10:53,279 --> 00:10:55,120
How is that human better than me?

118
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,960
The world, all beings, they're all mine.

119
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,600
What more do you want?

120
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,440
Love can't be forced,

121
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,240
nor can it be earned through effort.

122
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,799
Love is about giving,

123
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,919
not taking.

124
00:11:06,919 --> 00:11:08,000
Do you understand?

125
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,840
If you won't love me,

126
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,559
then so be it.

127
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,440
In that case,

128
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:19,360
I will destroy you piece by piece.

129
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,559
Why?

130
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:01,159
Her Love Flower has bloomed.

131
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:05,159
Why can't I still touch the Stone?

132
00:12:06,679 --> 00:12:08,279
Why?

133
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,159
It is impossible!

134
00:12:28,942 --> 00:12:32,870
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

135
00:12:33,142 --> 00:12:36,315
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

136
00:12:36,356 --> 00:12:39,988
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

137
00:12:40,013 --> 00:12:42,990
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

138
00:12:43,270 --> 00:12:45,700
♪Let the wind sweep away♪

139
00:12:45,700 --> 00:12:50,484
♪This heavy air of sorrow♪

140
00:12:50,686 --> 00:12:57,374
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

141
00:12:58,280 --> 00:13:01,950
♪Let towering waves come crashing down,
I'll fight against the tide♪

142
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:05,750
♪I shatter
the hollow fate they wrote for me♪

143
00:13:05,918 --> 00:13:12,147
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
